                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "“The act of freeing the voice has an alchemical influence on emotions, allowing us to approach fear, sorrow, or any other painful emotions as musical moods that can be expressed through sound.”",
                      "marks": [
                        {
