        {
          "id": "blk_dtwmw96syk",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "My vocal alchemy sessions are designed to meet you exactly where you are and guide you into the next octave of your expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "If you're yearning to feel more "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "comfortable, confident, and free in your authentic expression",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": ", these sessions are for you. Together, we unravel the roots of limiting beliefs that may have kept your voice suppressed. Whether it's the fear of judgment, the belief that your voice \"isn't good enough,\" or that you \"can't sing\"."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "These sessions are not about conforming to a standard but about discovering and embracing the "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "beauty of your unique sound and its healing powers. ",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        },
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "During our time together, I weave a variety of practices to support your liberation and intentions, whether it's a cathartic release process, vocal play exercises, sounding techniques, or inner child healing."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "You will connect with the healing power of your voice and walk away with a personalized toolkit that empowers your voice and authentic expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "hardBreak"
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "If you are ready to..."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "bulletList",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Reclaim your innocence, power, and freedom through expression"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Learn to use your voice for emotional and physical healing"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Share more of your voice and gifts with humanity"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Feel more comfortable and confident in your authentic expression"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Connect with your creativity as an outlet for your emotions"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "listItem",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "paragraph",
                          "content": [
                            {
                              "type": "text",
                              "text": "Discover the therapeutic ways sound can support your nervous system"
                            }
                          ]
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Let's awaken the healing power of your voice!"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
