          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "As a child, singing was my greatest joy. Yet, there was a moment where my voice was criticized and my song turned silent for over ten years. It took a breakup and a flood of emotions to rediscover the transformative power of my own voice."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "In the depths of despair, I turned to journaling, and singing the words on the page became a visceral cathartic experience that awakened the knowing and remembrance that I could express my emotions through sound. It was a pivotal moment that ignited my passion for music and self-expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "My journey led me to "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "study sound healing, sacred song facilitation, medicine music, and the transformative practice of yoga of the voice.",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " I now LOVE helping individuals unlock the full potential of their voice and discovering its power for healing, fulfillment, and embodiment."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "​"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
